  "id": "USN-8696-1",
  "summary": "bind9 vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Bind incorrectly handled DNSSEC validation when a\ndomain was covered by both NSEC and NSEC3 records with only one type having\nan RRSIG. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause Bind to\ncrash, resulting in a denial of service.",
